ted all four call sites to use it. This makes the shared business concept (\"apply a percentage of a base amount only when eligible\") explicit and stated once, rather than an implicit pattern the reader has to spot independently four times.\n\n**APP Mass**:\n- Before (four modifier expressions): **43**\n- After (shared helper + four call sites): **41**\n- Mass Change: 43 → 41 (delta -2)\n\nThe mass reduction is modest — extracting a helper trades \"repeated inline logic\" for \"one shared conditional + several invocations,\" which doesn't dramatically lower total component count. The primary benefit is Rule 2/3 clarity (naming the shared shape), which per the rules takes priority over chasing a larger mass reduction.\n\n**Tests**: All 24 tests in `quote.spec.ts` pass after the refactor (verified via `pnpm test`); no other test files were affected.\n\n**Refactoring Applied**:\n- Extracted `amountIfEligible` helper to eliminate duplicated `condition ? base * rate : 0` pattern across 4 sites\n- Simplified `computeLoyaltyDiscount` from a 2-statement function to a single-expression arrow function\n- Kept all doc comments describing intent, updated to reflect the new shared helper\n- No renames needed — existing names already reveal intent correctly"}],"details":{"mode":"single","agentScope":"both","projectAgentsDir":"/home/experimenter/experiments/runs/2026-07-24_16-28-54_claim-office-example-mapping_v6.2-with-why-cleaned-pi_sonnet-5/.pi/agents","results":[{"agent":"refactor","agentSource":"project","task":"Test file: src/quote.spec.ts\nImplementation file: src/quote.ts\nPassing tests: 24 (all quote.spec.ts tests now implemented and passing)\nRecent Green phase: getBasePremiumForType now throws new Error(`Unknown item type: ${type}`) when BASE_PREMIUM_BY_ITEM_TYPE[type] is undefined, instead of silently returning undefined.\n\nThis completes the full quote.ts implementation (all 24 tests in the test list are now green). Please do a thorough refactor pass over the whole 